OL,3,AFormer American Idol contestant
OL,4,Asentenced to life in prison for
OL,5,Amurdering wife
OL,6,
OL,7,FA US man who once appeared on the TV
OL,8,Ftalent competition American Idol has
OL,9,Fbeen sentenced to life in prison
OL,10,Fwithout the possibility of parole for
OL,11,Fmurdering his wife.
OL,13,FCaleb Flynn, 40, was found guilty last
OL,14,Fweek after a short deliberation by the
OL,15,Fjury, which rejected his claim that an
OL,16,Fintruder broke into his Ohio home and
OL,17,Fshot his wife, Ashley Flynn, as she
OL,18,Fslept.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
