OL,3,AFormer American Idol contestant
OL,4,Asentenced to life in prison for
OL,5,Amurdering wife
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was also found guilty of eight
OL,8,Fadditional charges, including
OL,9,Faggravated murder and tampering with
OL,10,Fevidence.
OL,12,FLetters from his two daughters were
OL,13,Fread in court during the sentencing
OL,14,Fhearing on Monday, pleading with him to
OL,15,Ffinally admit his guilt and questioning
OL,16,Fwhy he killed their mother.
